<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  Five arcs in the game's five colours around a heart — the same palette the app gives its
  players, so the icon and the board agree, and the one thing the app actually counts in
  the middle of them. Drawn as a vector so it stays crisp at every density, and kept inside
  the middle 72dp of the 108dp adaptive canvas.

  The heart is generated, not drawn by hand: its path is four cubics mirrored about the
  centre line, then translated so its measured bounding box is centred on (54,54). The
  glyph this replaced was positioned by eye and sat seven units right of centre.
-->
